{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6357","title":"Xiaomi Unveils Xiaomi 18 Fold: The First Xiaomi Flagship Featuring Xiaomi XRING O3","desc":"Xiaomi today officially unveiled Xiaomi 18 Fold and Xiaomi Pad 9 Pro Max, both powered by Xiaomi XRING O3, at its new product launch event in Beijing. ","view_cnt":"906115","like_cnt":"10","add_time":"1788792001","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/693_operatorx_operatorx_opx/07/09/2026/d3cbab4a0471ff44271df0075911c465.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, CHINA, September 7, 2026 \u003c/strong\u003e- Xiaomi today officially unveiled Xiaomi 18 Fold and Xiaomi Pad 9 Pro Max, both powered by the latest Xiaomi XRING O3 SoC. As Xiaomi's first-ever mid-size foldable smartphone, Xiaomi 18 Fold strikes a balance between portability and an expansive display, folding to just the size of a passport and unfolding to reveal a 7.58-inch tablet-like display, all while weighing just 219g and measuring 5.02mm thick when unfolded.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTogether with Xiaomi 18 Fold, Xiaomi Pad 9 Pro Max is the latest addition to Xiaomi's flagship tablet lineup. Designed for professional productivity on a large display, it combines flagship performance with versatile functionality for a powerful, flexible user experience across work, creativity, and entertainment.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/504_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/9e613c8dfcdf0b4efcfdc11176764e62.jpg\" alt=\"A red folding phone is displayed in the foreground, with the phone in an open state showcasing a large screen. The back features three cameras and the brand logo. The overall design is modern and vibrant in color.\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNew Form Factor: From Single-Hand Fit to Full-Screen Views\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdopting the same √2:1 aspect ratio as standard A4 paper, Xiaomi 18 Fold achieves a higher screen utilization rate for a range of content, from 16:9 video and 4:3 photos to documents and more. With both the inner and outer displays sharing the same aspect ratio, transitioning from one screen to the next feels more natural, creating a truly seamless user experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhen folded, Xiaomi 18 Fold measures 117.8 × 83.6mm, with a thickness of 10.68mm. At 219g, the phone is lighter than all previous Xiaomi foldable smartphones. Super-elliptical large R corners and a flat-edge frame give the phone a smooth in-hand feel and appearance, while the compact 5.38-inch outer display makes it easy to perform inputs like pull-down, typing, or back gestures with just one hand.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/545_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/bd086926ebbfe944fcc9e39ab497451b.jpg\" alt=\"A red folding phone with a screen presenting a symmetrical petal shape, set against a dark background, featuring a minimalist and modern overall design.\"\u003eWhen unfolded, Xiaomi 18 Fold opens up to an expansive 7.58-inch main screen in a slim 5.02mm body. Optimized especially for Xiaomi 18 Fold, Xiaomi HyperOS delivers a seamless multi-window experience — with two-way split providing two well-proportioned viewing areas, while three-way split gives each section a layout close to that of mainstream full-screen smartphones.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFolding Architecture: Engineered for Greater Reliability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi 18 Fold is built for longevity with high-strength materials across all critical components, including a high-strength 7000-series aluminum alloy frame and Xiaomi Shield Glass 3.0 on both the outer display and back panel. The cover glass is further strengthened through ion implantation for improved drop resistance, and the new-generation Xiaomi proprietary hinge features a patented three-link design that wraps around the screen to provide added protection while creating more space for the display.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi 18 Fold debuts a dual-layer Ultra Thin Glass (UTG) structure, combining a 50μm upper UTG layer with an additional 30μm UTG support layer for enhanced inner display protection. At the same time, Xiaomi replaces the previous inorganic insulating material in the touch layer with a more stretchable organic film, further improving impact resistance. Together with reinforced hinge-area construction, these upgrades make Xiaomi 18 Fold Xiaomi's most reliable foldable smartphone to date, with 258% higher inner display impact resistance and support for drops from up to 1.2m. The optimized display stack also delivers a flatter inner display, with an average crease depth of no more than 30μm.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi XRING O3: Flagship AI SoC Unleashes Next-Gen Power\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eXiaomi 18 Fold is the first Xiaomi flagship powered by Xiaomi XRING O3, Xiaomi's second SoC designed entirely in-house. Built on a 3nm process, the chip packs 24 billion transistors—up from 19 billion on the previous generation—and combines a 10-core all-big-core CPU with a 16-core GPU. It also introduces architectural-level optimizations to CPU memory latency, speeding up data exchange for higher overall performance with lower power consumption\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eMaking up the 10 cores in the CPU are two Ultra cores, four Premium cores, and four Pro cores. Working together, they handle a full range of tasks while delivering 60% higher performance and 25% lower power consumption than the previous generation.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eFor graphics, XRING O3 is equipped with the all-new G2-Ultra NX GPU featuring a massive 16-core configuration. Boosting graphics performance by 85% and reducing power consumption by 64% compared to its predecessor, the new G2-Ultra NX sets a new standard for graphics performance on a smartphone.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eXRING O3 is also the first SoC to support the latest LPDDR6 RAM. Featuring data rates of up to 10,667 Mbps and a 24-bit interface width — up from 16-bit on LPDDR5X — the new RAM achieves a total memory bandwidth of 113.8 GB/s, marking an almost 50% increase over LPDDR5X-9600.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/593_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/fc53394c0032bed036cfc9ad194eb00f.jpg\" alt=\"Red folding phone display, screen opens to show the internal interface, with a camera module on the outside.\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eXiaomi XRING O3 is an AI flagship SoC with AI deeply integrated at the architectural level. AI acceleration units are integrated across its key processing blocks, allowing lightweight AI workloads to be handled without unnecessarily invoking the NPU, improving execution efficiency while reducing power overhead.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eThe NPU is an all-new quad-core low-power design built on SIMT architecture. Each NPU core pairs a Tensor unit with dual Vector units, delivering 200 TOPS of tensor performance (A8W4) and 3.13 TFLOPS of vector performance. When combined with Xiaomi MiMo's proprietary five-value quantization technology, Xiaomi XRING O3 delivers 45% faster on-device decoding performance compared to the previous-gen flagship processor.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eThrough Xiaomi XRING O3, Xiaomi 18 Fold delivers stronger performance, longer battery life, and better thermal control than other foldables in everyday multitasking, large-screen gaming, and extended video playback.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLeica Photography, Perfected for the Fold\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eXiaomi 18 Fold's 200MP Leica triple-camera system is led by a 200MP main camera powered by a flagship HP5 1/1.56-inch sensor, supporting native high dynamic range and in-sensor lossless zoom. Alongside the main camera, Xiaomi 18 Fold also features a 50MP Leica periscope telephoto camera with an inverted design that reduces module size while delivering smooth, naturally rounded bokeh. With its 80mm focal length, the camera is ideal for portrait photography, while its in-sensor zoom extends the range to 160mm with lossless zoom, making it equally versatile for landscape photography.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/358_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/7d2d1b62c2c45032061520ccb60483da.jpg\" alt=\"A red mobile phone with three cameras on the back, and the word \u0026quot;xiaomi\u0026quot; printed on it.\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAn Uncompromising Experience From Front to Back\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eXiaomi 18 Fold is the first foldable smartphone to feature Xiaomi HyperRGB panels on its inner and outer displays that utilize a full RGB subpixel structure to make complete use of red, green, and blue subpixels. Both screens are Super Sunlight Displays, outputting up to 4,000 nits peak brightness with support for a 1-120Hz LTPO adaptive refresh rate, ensuring on-screen content remains clearly visible even in direct sunlight or bright indoor lighting.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003ePacking a 6000mAh Silicon-carbon Battery, Xiaomi 18 Fold features the largest battery capacity among the same form factor. Both cells adopt a stacking process with 20% high silicon content and energy density up to 920Wh/L. Xiaomi 18 Fold supports 67W wired and 50W wireless HyperCharge.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eFor connectivity, Xiaomi 18 Fold features Xiaomi Astral Communication with global roaming coverage in over 210 countries and regions, supported by more than 52 carriers, plus Wi-Fi 7 and UWB ultra-wideband connectivity.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/142_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/3deb0e7ca9c548f281908a9573db1b9b.jpg\" alt=\"The red phone showcases its foldable design, with the screen opened to display the internal interface, and three camera modules on the back. The overall appearance is minimalist and modern.\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCeramic Edition: Modern Innovation for a Timeless Look\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/414_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/cef1687ef6b6b6858cae313fa20e329a.jpg\" alt=\"A pink smartphone with three cameras on the back and a brand logo at the top. The phone has a smooth appearance and a modern design.\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eXiaomi 18 Fold also comes in a special Ceramic Edition, featuring lightweight silicon nitride ceramic on the back panel — the first time this material has been used for a smartphone back panel. Silicon nitride is an advanced ceramic material that is commonly used in automotive and aircraft engines for its high-temperature resistance. It combines a warm, smooth ceramic feel with exceptionally high hardness, while weighing approximately 50% less than traditional zirconia ceramic.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/684_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/849cf7144fc953a218dc940ed49e0775.jpg\" alt=\"Four smartphones in different colors are displayed side by side, including gold, black, red, and pink, with a camera module on the back.\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Pad 9 Pro Max: A 13.3-Inch Flagship for Professional Productivity\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi also announces Xiaomi Pad 9 Pro Max, the latest addition to Xiaomi's flagship tablet lineup, designed to deliver a professional productivity experience on a large screen. Powered by the latest Xiaomi XRING O3 processor and Xiaomi HyperOS, it combines powerful performance, intelligent AI capabilities, and seamless multitasking to support demanding productivity and creative tasks.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Pad 9 Pro Max features a 13.3-inch 3.4K display with a 3408 × 2272 resolution and 144Hz refresh rate, delivering sharp and smooth visuals. With up to 1000 nits of brightness, content remains clear and visible in various lighting conditions. Professional original color mode and multi-screen color consistency deliver accurate, consistent, and stable color reproduction across devices, making it ideal for professional creative and productivity workflows.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAt its core, Xiaomi Pad 9 Pro Max is powered by Xiaomi XRING O3, featuring a new 10-core all-big-core CPU design and the latest G2-Ultra NX GPU to deliver flagship performance and AI capabilities, with an AnTuTu score of over 5.61 million. Compared with tablets powered by Xiaomi XRING O1, CPU multi-core performance is improved by 54%, while GPU performance is improved by 85%, enabling Xiaomi Pad 9 Pro Max to handle demanding workloads and entertainment with ease. Running on Xiaomi HyperOS, it delivers a smarter and more efficient large-screen experience. Enhanced multitasking allows users to run multiple applications simultaneously, while AI-powered features help streamline everyday tasks and boost productivity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEquipped with a 12000mAh battery and 120W HyperCharge, Xiaomi Pad 9 Pro Max provides long-lasting power throughout the day. Its 6-mic array with high signal-to-noise ratio microphones enables clearer audio pickup from greater distances, while Wi-Fi 7 provides fast and stable connectivity. For greater versatility, Xiaomi Pad 9 Pro Max introduces DP-in video input for the first time, supporting resolutions of up to 3.4K at 120Hz via a full-featured USB-C cable, offering greater flexibility across work, gaming, and creative scenarios.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/618_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/07/09/2026/7f8e9f1c61349453cede56cde94aa38b.jpg\" alt=\"Three laptops are displayed side by side, with the left one being purple and equipped with a white stylus, the screen showing a soft purple sheen; the middle one is dark-colored, and the right one is silver, both having keyboards. The background is pure white.\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePricing \u0026amp; Availability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi 18 Fold\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eXiaomi 18 Fold is available in four variants: Black, White, Red, and Ceramic Version.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eXiaomi 18 Fold comes in four storage variants:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e12GB+256GB - RMB 10999 yuan\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e12GB+512GB - RMB 11999 yuan\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e16GB+512GB - RMB 12999 yuan\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e16GB+1TB - RMB 14999 yuan\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eXiaomi 18 Fold Ceramic Version is only available in the 16GB+1TB variant, starting at RMB 15999 yuan.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi Pad 9 Pro Max\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eXiaomi Pad 9 Pro Max is available in three variants: Black, Silver, and Red.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eXiaomi Pad 9 Pro Max comes in five storage variants:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e8GB+256GB - RMB 4799 yuan\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e12GB+256GB - RMB 5299 yuan\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e12GB+512GB - RMB 6099 yuan\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e16GB+256GB - RMB 5799 yuan\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e16GB+512GB - RMB 6599 yuan\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eXiaomi Pad 9 Pro Max Matte Glass Version is only available in Red and the following two storage variants:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e16GB+512GB - RMB 6899 yuan\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e16GB+1TB - RMB 7899 yuan\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eENDS\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch1 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones, smart hardware, and smart electric vehicles connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eEmbracing our vision of \"Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users' hearts\", Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The Company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eXiaomi is one of the world's leading smartphone companies. In June 2026, the MAU reached 766.5 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The Company has also established the world's leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform. As of June 30, 2026, the number of IoT devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops, and tablets) reached 1,160.8 million. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to \"Human × Car × Home\" smart ecosystem, seamlessly merging personal devices, smart home products, and cars. The Company has rapidly emerged as a leading innovator in the smart electric vehicle industry, reaching profitability within six quarters of commencing deliveries and delivering over 800,000 units by September 2026. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In July 2026, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the eighth year in a row, ranking 232nd.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"1093","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1788791948"},"common":null}